        "title": "Language Targets",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Language Targets",
          "Aspects Examples 1 Describe general things about family. My family is big. / Our family has good traditions. 2 State relationships. Peter is my brother. / Kevin and Tom are my dad’s nephews. / I have a step mother. 3 Talk about family members. John is my cousin, he is a doctor and he works in a hospital.",
          "When we talk about families and relatives there are certain aspects that we can include in this topic.",
          "TO CONSIDER Most of the statements about family take To Be. However, we can use other verbs to talk about this matter."
